{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "slider",
	"title": "Slider 滑块",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "在给定范围内拖动选择一个值或一个区间。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"bits-ui@2.20.0",
		"@internationalized/date@^3.12.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"滑块",
				"slider",
				"范围",
				"range",
				"拖动"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"在已知范围内粗略选择数值，如音量",
				"用 type=multiple 选择区间或多个值"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "需要精确输入数值",
					"use": "slider-field"
				},
				{
					"case": "没有明确范围的数字",
					"use": "number-field"
				},
				{
					"case": "只展示完成度、不可调整",
					"use": "progress"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"用 aria-label 或 aria-labelledby 命名可聚焦的滑块把手；指向根元素 id 的 HTML label 不能命名内部把手",
				"多个把手用 thumbLabels 按值的顺序分别命名",
				"方向键调整数值"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"支持触摸拖动，窄屏下占满容器宽度",
				"orientation=vertical 纵向显示，需要给出高度"
			],
			"related": [
				"slider-field",
				"number-field",
				"progress"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Slider 设计规范\n\n- 只适合粗略调整的连续值；需要看到或输入精确数值时用 Slider Field（滑块加数字输入框），没有明确范围的数字用 Number Field。\n- 滑块必须有名称：设 `aria-label` 或 `aria-labelledby`，多个滑块（范围选择）用 `thumbLabels` 给每个滑块单独命名；`Field.Label for` 无法关联滑块（检查规则 `valar/input-label`）。\n- 必须设 `type=\"single\"` 或 `type=\"multiple\"`，并给出 `min`、`max`、`step`；值用 `bind:value`。\n- 竖向滑块用 `orientation=\"vertical\"`，并给父容器明确的高度。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "slider/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./slider.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Slider,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "slider/index.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { Slider as SliderPrimitive } from \"bits-ui\";\n\timport { cn, type WithoutChildrenOrChild } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tvalue = $bindable(),\n\t\torientation = \"horizontal\",\n\t\t\"aria-label\": ariaLabel,\n\t\t\"aria-labelledby\": ariaLabelledby,\n\t\tthumbLabels,\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildrenOrChild<SliderPrimitive.RootProps> & { thumbLabels?: string[] } = $props();\n</script>\n\n<!--\nDiscriminated Unions + Destructing (required for bindable) do not\nget along, so we shut typescript up by casting `value` to `never`.\n-->\n<SliderPrimitive.Root\n\tbind:ref\n\tbind:value={value as never}\n\tdata-slot=\"slider\"\n\t{orientation}\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"data-vertical:min-h-40 relative flex w-full touch-none items-center select-none data-disabled:opacity-50 data-vertical:h-full data-vertical:w-auto data-vertical:flex-col\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{#snippet children({ thumbItems })}\n\t\t<span\n\t\t\tdata-slot=\"slider-track\"\n\t\t\tdata-orientation={orientation}\n\t\t\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\t\t\"bg-input/50 data-horizontal:h-0.5 data-horizontal:w-full data-vertical:h-full data-vertical:w-0.5 relative grow overflow-hidden data-horizontal:w-full data-vertical:h-full\"\n\t\t\t)}\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<SliderPrimitive.Range\n\t\t\t\tdata-slot=\"slider-range\"\n\t\t\t\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\t\t\t\"bg-primary absolute select-none data-horizontal:h-full data-vertical:w-full\"\n\t\t\t\t)}\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</span>\n\t\t{#each thumbItems as thumb (thumb.index)}\n\t\t\t<SliderPrimitive.Thumb\n\t\t\t\tdata-slot=\"slider-thumb\"\n\t\t\t\tindex={thumb.index}\n\t\t\t\taria-label={thumbLabels?.[thumb.index] ?? ariaLabel}\n\t\t\t\taria-labelledby={ariaLabelledby}\n\t\t\t\tclass=\"size-3 border-none bg-primary transition-colors hover:ring-2 hover:ring-ring/30 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/30 focus-visible:outline-hidden block shrink-0 select-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t{/each}\n\t{/snippet}\n</SliderPrimitive.Root>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "slider/slider.svelte"
		}
	]
}